{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16212140","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16212140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621214001:0":{"text":"こんなに早く調合できるなんて……しかもこの配合比率、完璧だな。","source_cn":"这么快就配好了……而且这比例——近乎完美。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C99673538EEC0CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621214002:0":{"text":"熟練の薬師でさえ、ここまで短時間で仕上げるのは難しいだろう……","source_cn":"就算是经验老到的药师，也未必能在这么短的时间内做到这一步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02E0599936C8A9B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621214003:0":{"text":"さすがはレヒラムの精鋭たち、何をさせても抜かりないな。","source_cn":"果然，莱希拉姆的精英们，不管做什么都不含糊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A6D8A7E2C7D5FD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621214004:1":{"text":"さあ、これを飲んでごらん……味はいまいちだけど、きっと楽になるからね。","source_cn":"好了，小家伙，来一点这个……味道不算好，但会让你轻松些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6757CD587932E68E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621214005:1":{"text":"ハーメルは慎重に、少しずつ薬をリスに飲ませた。","source_cn":"哈梅尔小心地将药缓缓喂给松鼠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFAB74C3C4A129E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621214006:1":{"text":"ど……どうですか？","source_cn":"它……好点了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7B6F73ABA490A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621214007:1":{"text":"緩和薬は魔法みたいにすぐ効くわけじゃないんだ。だからもう少し待ってくれる？","source_cn":"舒缓药可不像魔法那样立竿见影，还得等上一会儿。魔法师朋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F0899E63B77AC6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:8:1621214008:0":{"text":"待っている間、ハーメルは傍らに腰を下ろし、笛を吹き始めた。","source_cn":"等待期间，哈梅尔坐在一旁吹起了笛子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F0263DD6A9F8A33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:9:1621214009:0":{"text":"その曲は風のように軽やかで、木々の間を舞うように響き渡った。やがて物憂げな色を帯び始め、まるで遠い記憶をたどるように沈み込むと、そっと余韻を残して消えていった……","source_cn":"那曲子如风般轻快，旋律在林间盘旋，而后渐渐带上几分低落...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x898E5D18408626A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1621214010:0":{"text":"カスティーが思わず拍手を送ると、ハーメルは立ち上がり、帽子を取って彼女に一礼した。","source_cn":"曲终，科丝蒂鼓起掌来，而哈梅尔则下意识地摘帽，朝她行了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E0E38A0DF66373E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1621214011:1":{"text":"ハーメルさん、その子が目を覚ましました！","source_cn":"哈梅尔先生，它睁眼了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8087069ADD6B792","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621214012:1":{"text":"ああ、これこそ生命の神秘……","source_cn":"是的，真是感慨生命的神奇……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1A9F9F2C59165CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:哈梅尔":{"text":"ハーメル","source":"哈梅尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"ナレーション","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:科丝蒂":{"text":"カスティー","source":"科丝蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"黒画面","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":4}}